= Moldavian Democratic Republic

In the former province of Bessarabia, a "Moldavian Democratic Republic" has been declared as an autonomous polity within the Russian Republic. A provisional government is declared in Chișinău, although various local governments and soviets contest its authority.

The declaration seemingly accelerates the disintegration of the Imperial Army in the southwestern front, with violence breaking out bwtween local Moldavan forces and deserting Russian soldiers. 

